     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-7§7 `CopperBulbBlock` and `WeatheringCopperBulbBlock`: default state (7.1): lit and powered false; 4 states; never a redstone conductor (lit, powered, states, conductor kind 1" TO TL-CASE
